{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nMy first stop was Tokyo, where I marveled at the towering skyscrapers and bustling streets of Shibuya. I spent hours exploring the city's many neighborhoods, sampling delicious street food and taking in the vibrant atmosphere. One of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I watched as fishermen auctioned off the day's freshest catch.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I traveled to Kyoto, where I immersed myself in the city's rich cultural heritage. I spent hours wandering through the serene gardens and temples of the Fushimi Inari shrine, and was awestruck by the stunning beauty of the Kinkaku-ji temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion.\n\nThroughout my journey, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt welcomed and at ease. Japan is a country that seamlessly blends tradition and innovation, and my trip was a fascinating glimpse into this unique and captivating culture. I'm already planning my next trip back to this incredible country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.416728138923645}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0032290483359247446}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20428143441677094}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5881327390670776}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003500564198475331}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.0002615109842736274}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.000134220